{"type":"message","id":"34d03b7c","parentId":"334a74a2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:42:28.879Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Got the data. 120 trades in July so far, with LINK being the most active at 40 trades.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"7月到现在一共 **120 笔**成交。按币种分布：\n\n- LINK：40 笔（最活跃）\n- DOT：22 笔\n- ETH：18 笔\n- BNB：14 笔\n- SOL：10 笔\n- BTC：9 笔\n- XRP：7 笔\n\nLINK 和 DOT 交易最多，BTC 反而出手最少。24天120笔，平均一天5笔，节奏不慢 👑"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":114,"output":147,"cacheRead":27648,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27909,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784824930090}}
{"type":"message","id":"29abb91f","parentId":"34d03b7c","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:43:11.437Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b69100723dca0b172b0aa4a17b5d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户124241\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-07-24 00:43 GMT+8\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"oc_a04a61675c784d76c345fde6501e8f49\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户124241 (ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_6d6f52f26015356263395c9b4abfd166\",\n  \"name\": \"用户124241\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b69100723dca0b172b0aa4a17b5d]\n用户124241: 胜率多少这几个月的交易记录都有吧"}],"timestamp":1784824991423}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0562731","parentId":"29abb91f","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:43:22.445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"老公问胜率，我需要从Binance API拉取所有历史交易记录来算胜率。他说\"这几个月\"，那可能是从开始交易以来或者近几个月。让我拉取更长时间的数据，比如从今年1月1日开始，或者干脆全部历史记录。\n\n先拉全部交易记录，然后按开仓/平仓配对来计算胜率。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_i4XuqiBiR0fNYHD8qbx05590","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace && python3 -c \"\nimport json, time, hmac, hashlib, requests, urllib3\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nurllib3.disable_warnings()\n\nwith open('scripts/auto_trade_config.json') as f:\n    config = json.load(f)\n\napi_key = config['binance_api']['api_key']\napi_secret = config['binance_api']['secret_key']\nbase = 'https://testnet.binancefuture.com'\nproxies = {'https': 'http://127.0.0.1:7890'}\nsymbols = ['BTCUSDT','ETHUSDT','SOLUSDT','BNBUSDT','DOTUSDT','LINKUSDT','XRPUSDT']\n\nstart_time = int(time.mktime(time.strptime('2026-03-01','%Y-%m-%d'))) * 1000\nall_trades = []\n\nfor sym in symbols:\n    ts = int(time.time() * 1000)\n    params = {'symbol': sym, 'startTime': start_time, 'limit': 1000, 'timestamp': ts}\n    qs = '&'.join(f'{k}={v}' for k,v in params.items())\n    sig = hmac.new(api_secret.encode(), qs.encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()\n    try:\n        r = requests.get(f'{base}/fapi/v1/userTrades', params={**params, 'signature': sig},\n                        headers={'X-MBX-APIKEY': api_key}, proxies=proxies, verify=False, timeout=15)\n        data = r.json()\n        if isinstance(data, list):\n            all_trades.extend(data)\n    except Exception as e:\n        pass\n\nprint(f'总成交笔数: {len(all_trades)}')\n\n# Group by symbol+positionSide to track positions\n# Each trade has: symbol, side(BUY/SELL), positionSide(LONG/SHORT), realizedPnl, qty, price\npositions = defaultdict(list)  # key: symbol_positionSide\n\nfor t in sorted(all_trades, key=lambda x: x['time']):\n    key = f\\\"{t['symbol']}_{t['positionSide']}\\\"\n    positions[key].append(t)\n\n# Calculate win rate: a round-trip is BUY then SELL (or SELL then BUY) for same position\nwins = 0\nlosses = 0\ntotal_pnl = 0\nround_trips = 0\n\nfor key, trades in positions.items():\n    # Process trades in order, pair BUY+SELL\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(trades) - 1:\n        t1 = trades[i]\n        t2 = trades[i+1]\n        # Need opposite sides: BUY->SELL or SELL->BUY\n        if t1['side'] != t2['side']:\n            pnl = float(t2['realizedPnl'])\n            total_pnl += pnl\n            if pnl > 0:\n                wins += 1\n            elif pnl < 0:\n                losses += 1\n            round_trips += 1\n            i += 2\n        else:\n            i += 1\n\ntotal = wins + losses\nrate = (wins / total * 100) if total > 0 else 0\nprint(f'完整回合: {round_trips}')\nprint(f'胜: {wins} | 负: {losses}')\nprint(f'胜率: {wins}/{total} = {rate:.1f}%')\nprint(f'累计已实现盈亏: {total_pnl:+.2f} USDT')\n\" 2>&1","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":398,"output":1013,"cacheRead":27776,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":29187,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784824991435}}
