{"type":"message","id":"e2191487","parentId":"8e546870","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:44:56.591Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so the request works fine with BTCUSDT - returns 9 trades. The issue was in that loop, probably the symbol list wasn't right, or the symbols filter was filtering out results. Let me check - the issue is that `positionSide` is `BOTH` (not LONG or SHORT), and my grouping logic was using positionSide. Also, the previous attempt with 0 results was the same code run monolithically - maybe there was an issue with my for loop.\n\nBut more importantly, the trade data shows `positionSide: \"BOTH\"` (hedge mode off). So I need to adjust the grouping logic. With BOTH position side, BUY opens (if no position) and SELL closes, or SELL opens and BUY closes. The pairing is simply BUY matched to SELL in FIFO order.\n\nAlso, some `realizedPnl` is already in the trade - the one that closes the position has the PnL. Let me rewrite the logic: just pair BUY+SELL sequentially within the same symbol, and use realizedPnl from the closing trade.\n\nBut wait, the first run said 0 trades. That's strange. Let me run it again more carefully.\n\nActually, looking at the trade data - each trade has `realizedPnl` directly. The closing trade includes the PnL. So I need to pair BUY→SELL and SELL→BUY. With `positionSide: \"BOTH\"`, it doesn't differentiate LONG/SHORT.\n\nLet me rewrite the script to just use symbol as key and pair opposite sides.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_SBdeYJATNqTk3rWD3RmC3870","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport json, time, sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\nsymbols = ['BTC','ETH','SOL','BNB','DOT','LINK','XRP']\nstart_time = int(time.mktime(time.strptime('2026-03-01','%Y-%m-%d'))) * 1000\n\nall_trades = []\nfor sym in symbols:\n    r = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades',\n                    {'symbol': f'{sym}USDT', 'startTime': start_time, 'limit': 1000})\n    if isinstance(r, list):\n        all_trades.extend(r)\n\nall_trades.sort(key=lambda x: x['time'])\nprint(f'总成交笔数: {len(all_trades)}')\n\n# Pair trades: BUY->SELL or SELL->BUY (positionSide is BOTH in hedge-off mode)\n# For each symbol, run FIFO matching\nby_symbol = defaultdict(list)\nfor t in all_trades:\n    by_symbol[t['symbol']].append(t)\n\nwins = 0\nlosses = 0\nbreakevens = 0\ntotal_pnl = 0.0\nmonthly_pnl = defaultdict(float)\nmonthly_w = defaultdict(int)\nmonthly_l = defaultdict(int)\n\nfor sym, trades in by_symbol.items():\n    queue = []  # open trades\n    for t in trades:\n        side = t['side']  # BUY or SELL\n        qty = float(t['qty'])\n        pnl = float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0) or 0)\n        price = float(t['price'])\n        ts = t['time'] / 1000\n        month = time.strftime('%Y-%m', time.localtime(ts))\n\n        if side == 'BUY':\n            queue.append({'qty': qty, 'price': price, 'time': ts})\n        else:  # SELL\n            # Match against BUYs in FIFO\n            remain = qty\n            while remain > 0 and queue:\n                matched = queue.pop(0)\n                match_qty = min(remain, matched['qty'])\n                remain -= match_qty\n                matched['qty'] -= match_qty\n                if matched['qty'] > 0.001:\n                    queue.insert(0, matched)  # Put back remaining\n                # We only count when BUY is fully consumed (round trip complete)\n                if matched['qty'] <= 0.001:\n                    total_pnl += pnl\n                    monthly_pnl[month] += pnl\n                    if pnl > 0:\n                        wins += 1\n                        monthly_w[month] += 1\n                    elif pnl < 0:\n                        losses += 1\n                        monthly_l[month] += 1\n                    else:\n                        breakevens += 1\n\ntotal_rt = wins + losses + breakevens\nrate = (wins/(wins+losses)*100) if (wins+losses) > 0 else 0\nprint(f'\\\\n📊 累计战绩 (3月至今)')\nprint(f'完整回合: {total_rt}')\nprint(f'胜: {wins} | 负: {losses} | 平: {breakevens}')\nprint(f'胜率: {rate:.1f}%')\nprint(f'累计已实现盈亏: {total_pnl:+.2f} USDT')\nprint(f'\\\\n📅 月度明细:')\nfor m in sorted(monthly_pnl.keys()):\n    t = monthly_w[m] + monthly_l[m]\n    r = (monthly_w[m]/t*100) if t > 0 else 0\n    print(f'  {m}: {monthly_w[m]}/{t} = {r:.1f}% | PnL {monthly_pnl[m]:+.2f}U')\nPYEOF","timeout":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":557,"output":1608,"cacheRead":33792,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":35957,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784825075775}}
