{"type":"message","id":"b9560c2b","parentId":"5dddeeb0","timestamp":"2026-07-23T16:48:47.022Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK, so the data shows:\n- 59 trades with non-zero PnL (these are the ones that reduced position size)\n- 17 wins, 42 losses = 28.8% win rate\n- -4.61 USDT total realized PnL\n\nBut wait - these small values like -0.0060, -0.0282 etc are all tiny. Each is like -0.02 to -0.03 USDT each. 59 trades with an average of about -0.078 USDT each. These are all very small losses. \n\nThe issue is that many of these are probably partial position reductions from the same closing order. One closing SELL might generate 20+ partial BUY fills (as market taker). These are not individual \"round trips\" - they're all part of the same closing.\n\nI need to group by orderId to count actual round trips. Trades with the same orderId are part of the same order execution.\n\nLet me regroup by orderId.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_aAW3AVDmDRCYFXsqL4SX7219","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts && python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport json, time, sys\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nsys.path.insert(0, '.')\nimport binance_auto_trade as bat\n\nsymbols = ['BTC','ETH','SOL','BNB','DOT','LINK','XRP']\nstart = int(time.mktime(time.strptime('2026-04-01','%Y-%m-%d'))) * 1000\n\nall_trades = []\nfor sym in symbols:\n    r = bat.request('GET', '/fapi/v1/userTrades',\n                    {'symbol': f'{sym}USDT', 'startTime': start, 'limit': 1000})\n    if isinstance(r, list):\n        all_trades.extend(r)\n\nall_trades.sort(key=lambda x: x['time'])\n\n# Group by orderId - trades from the same order are one \"decision\"\norder_groups = defaultdict(list)\nfor t in all_trades:\n    order_groups[t['orderId']].append(t)\n\n# For each order, sum PnL\norder_results = []\nfor oid, trades in order_groups.items():\n    total_pnl = sum(float(t.get('realizedPnl', 0) or 0) for t in trades)\n    total_qty = sum(float(t['qty']) for t in trades)\n    sym = trades[0]['symbol']\n    side = trades[0]['side']\n    ts = trades[0]['time']\n    order_results.append({\n        'symbol': sym, 'side': side, 'pnl': total_pnl,\n        'qty': total_qty, 'time': ts,\n        'month': time.strftime('%Y-%m', time.localtime(ts/1000))\n    })\n\norder_results.sort(key=lambda x: x['time'])\n\n# Winning orders (with non-zero PnL) represent completed round trips\nclosing_orders = [o for o in order_results if abs(o['pnl']) > 0.001]\nwins = sum(1 for o in closing_orders if o['pnl'] > 0.001)\nlosses = sum(1 for o in closing_orders if o['pnl'] < -0.001)\ntotal_pnl = sum(o['pnl'] for o in closing_orders)\n\nmonthly = defaultdict(lambda: {'w': 0, 'l': 0, 'pnl': 0.0})\nfor o in closing_orders:\n    if o['pnl'] > 0.001:\n        monthly[o['month']]['w'] += 1\n    else:\n        monthly[o['month']]['l'] += 1\n    monthly[o['month']]['pnl'] += o['pnl']\n\ntotal_orders = len(order_results)\ntotal_closing = len(closing_orders)\nrate = wins/(wins+losses)*100 if (wins+losses) > 0 else 0\n\nprint(f'总订单数: {total_orders}')\nprint(f'其中平仓订单(有盈亏): {total_closing}')\nprint(f'胜: {wins} | 负: {losses}')\nprint(f'胜率: {rate:.1f}%')\nprint(f'累计已实现: {total_pnl:+.2f} USDT')\n\nprint(f'\\n📅 月度明细:')\nfor m in sorted(monthly.keys()):\n    d = monthly[m]\n    t = d['w'] + d['l']\n    r = d['w']/t*100 if t > 0 else 0\n    print(f'  {m}: {d[\"w\"]}/{t} = {r:.1f}% | PnL {d[\"pnl\"]:+.2f}U')\n\n# Show latest 10 closing orders\nprint(f'\\n最近10笔平仓:')\nfor o in closing_orders[-10:]:\n    tstr = time.strftime('%m-%d %H:%M', time.localtime(o['time']/1000))\n    print(f'  {tstr} {o[\"symbol\"]} {o[\"side\"]} PnL={o[\"pnl\"]:+.4f}')\nPYEOF","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1055,"output":1389,"cacheRead":44160,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46604,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784825313509}}
